<h2>My story</h2>
<p>I started sharing beauty on Instagram about three or four years ago and slowly built a community of women who love skincare as much as I do. Last year I added a YouTube channel with weekly travel vlogs, shopping reviews and skincare vlogs in a quiet, aesthetic style. I studied applied informatics, I also have a remote job, and I went to art school alongside regular school, which is probably why I care so much about colour, light and small details.</p>
<p>Outside of skincare I love travel, photography and filming, and I stay active with yoga, pilates, boxing, tennis, padel, swimming, cycling, hiking, skiing and surfing. A healthy lifestyle for me means movement, good food, sleep and a calm mind, and I like romanticizing small daily moments.</p>

